  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your eruption of holy power leaves your enemies reeling.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Greater Channel Force<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using this feat, add a +2 bonus on combat maneuver checks made to push or pull targets in the area; this bonus stacks with the bonus for Mythic Channel Force and Mythic Improved Channel Force. You may push some targets and pull others. If you expend one use of mythic power, you can increase the save DC by an amount equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1), and creatures that fail their saves are staggered for 1 round in addition to other effects. When you use this feat, you may expend one use of mythic power to increase or decrease the radius of your burst by 5 feet, plus 5 feet per 2 tiers after 1st.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
